FDWM's own cleanup. colorbar's extra color schemes (SchemeStatus,
SchemeTagsNorm, SchemeInfoSel and SchemeInfoNorm) all drew in col_fg on
col_bg, like SchemeNorm, so the status text, the tags, the layout symbol and
the title are drawn with SchemeNorm again and the schemes are gone, as is the
fourth color in each scheme, which nothing read: the bar looks the same.
dmenumon, which spawn() set for dmenu's -m, is gone too: dmenucmd hasn't
passed -m since FDWM went to one monitor. And the rule floating feh, which
FDWM doesn't install.

